  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for SkillBridge', 'description': 'Primary container for SkillBridge implementation: The Skill Gap Analyzer is a web-based tool designed to help users compare their current skills with those required for a desired job or career path. It offers personalized analysis and recommends learning resources to help users bridge their skill gaps and advance their careers.', 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Skill Assessment",\n      "description": "Allows users to input and assess their current skills.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Job/Career Path Selection",\n      "description": "Enables users to select a target job or career path for comparison.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Gap Analysis",\n      "description": "Compares user skills with job requirements and highlights missing skills.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Personalized Recommendations",\n      "description": "Suggests learning resources and courses to help users bridge identified skill gaps.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Progress Tracking",\n      "description": "Lets users track their progress as they acquire new skills.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#4F8A8B",\n    "secondary": "#FBD46D",\n    "accent": "#F6416C"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI features a vibrant header with the project title, followed by a two-column layout. The left column allows users to input their current skills and select a target job. The right column displays the gap analysis results and personalized learning recommendations. Colorful cards and progress bars visually represent skill gaps and progress. The design uses bold accent colors for buttons and highlights, with a clean, modern look."\n}'}",
